{"id":"wx2652708737","title":"广州唯一！南沙华农渔业研究院，正式启用！","published_at":"2023-03-28T19:30:15+08:00","published_label":"2023-03-28","cover":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlcibhf31LaxxWPdRICxvJFIGiavY4r3rsJfAGvWHBFE72HuiaEOzkzPJsCUR8shDDKSJEm2AicIKVP6ibEw/0?wx_fmt=jpeg","summary":"由广东省农业农村厅 南沙经济技术开发区管理委员会 和华南农业大学三方共建的 渔业科技创新机构—— 广州南沙华农渔业研究院 （以下简称“研究院”） 在校地共同努力下 近期完成科研、办公等场所建设 3月28日 研究院启用仪式 在南沙渔业产业园综…","tags":["科研"],"source":"wechat","original_url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&mid=2652708737&idx=1&sn=00d0999aed4e2ce51fd273620226eb3c","paper_url":null,"word_count":1717,"fetched_at":"2026-11-09T17:00:11+08:00","content_html":"<div><p><span>由广东省农业农村厅</span></p><p><span>南沙经济技术开发区管理委员会</span></p><p><span>和华南农业大学三方共建的</span></p><p><span>渔业科技创新机构——</span></p><p><span><strong><span>广州南沙华农渔业研究院</span></strong></span></p><p><span>（以下简称“研究院”）</span></p><p><span>在校地共同努力下</span></p><section><span>近期完成科研、办公等场所建设</span></section><p><span>3月28日</span></p><p><strong><span>研究院启用仪式</span></strong></p><p><span>在南沙渔业产业园综合服务中心举办</span></p><p><span>将按照</span></p><p><span>“立足南沙、面向湾区、服务全国”的定位</span></p><p><span>整合资源、创新制度</span></p><p><span>瞄准我国渔业产业中的实际问题</span></p><p><span>攻克产业技术瓶颈，促进产业转型升级</span></p><p><span>致力于建成</span></p><p><span><strong><span>以现代水产种业科技创新为引领的</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>有世界影响力的</span></strong></span></p><section><span><strong><span>国际水产种业创新高地</span></strong></span></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlcibhf31LaxxWPdRICxvJFIGiaNYC31tcHRAZSqibRwdS83ywdaf5yKrWh78EIL8ABhBD3tTcuqEcdicQA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section><p><span>启用仪式</span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlcibhf31LaxxWPdRICxvJFIGiaibLYCNicXs7HABH6IvmF4KpdlnEmic3vaCCsoibpDORJZUwNQUTBUicXRVQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section><p><span>活动现场</span></p><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong>校地三方共建</strong></span></p><p><span><strong>广州市唯一渔业领域研究院</strong></span><strong></strong></p></section></section></section></section><p><span>为支撑大湾区现代渔业高质量发展</span></p><p><strong><span>广州南沙华农渔业研究院</span></strong></p><p><span>于2022年5月正式注册成立</span></p><p><span>由南沙区投入资金支持、</span></p><p><span>南沙区农业农村局提供业务指导</span></p><p><span>华南农业大学副校长温小波教授担任理事长</span></p><p><span>国家杰出青年基金获得者、</span></p><p><span>我校海洋学院院长秦启伟教授担任院长</span></p><section><strong><span>是广州市唯一一家渔业领域研究院</span></strong><br/></section><p><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlcibhf31LaxxWPdRICxvJFIGiaXKWGiabwagibk8P6PRHVwXJ9KKxdBZMqQ9yk1FbKgeowIDHfgu5fmKXg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></span></p><section><span>刘雅红在启用仪式上致辞</span></section><section><span>“华南农业大学始终坚持‘四个面向’</span></section><section><span>引导广大师生围绕国家重大战略</span></section><section><span>和地方经济社会发展需求</span></section><section><span>开展有组织的科研工作。”</span></section><section><span>广东省人大常委会副主任、</span></section><section><span>华南农业大学校长</span><span><strong><span>刘雅红</span></strong></span><span>表示</span></section><section><span>希望研究院</span></section><section><span>着力培育一流人才<br/><span>发挥产学研无缝衔接的优势</span></span></section><section><span>建成拔尖创新人才培养的基地<br/><span><span>努力打造创新高地</span></span></span></section><section><span>瞄准我国渔业产业中的实际问题</span></section><section><span>攻克产业技术瓶颈<br/><span>全力服务乡村振兴</span><br/>加快推进技术高标准研发、成果高效益转化</span></section><section><span>促进产业转型升级、提质</span><span>增</span><span>效</span></section><p><span>南沙区副区长</span><span><strong><span>刘小潼</span></strong></span><span>表示</span></p><p><span>南沙高度重视农业科技创新</span></p><p><span>与农业农村部共建国家数字渔业创新中心</span></p><p><span>先后与多家科研院所搭建一批重大科研平台</span></p><p><span>未来，南沙将以</span></p><p><span>广州南沙华农渔业研究院启用为契机</span></p><p><span>加快完善现代农业科技创新平台布局</span></p><p><span>推动南沙区构建现代种业产业体系</span></p><p><span>打造产学研结合和成果产业化</span></p><section><span>应用、示范、推广的新制高点</span></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>聚焦水产种业</strong></p><p><strong>科技赋能湾区</strong></p></section></section></section></section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlcibhf31LaxxWPdRICxvJFIGiaydBqHAeOoibRZIsVFys9dxKgv6c0jNDSJMdCVoglIYBQJVRYzgXCBDg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlcibhf31LaxxWPdRICxvJFIGiaBPPTkkyvJI4aAFQBMN6YrIP6V8YGJQYZBB66EhNCO1zVPYnU99VGOQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section><p><span>刘雅红为研究院第一届学术委员会颁发聘书</span></p><p><span>活动现场</span></p><p><span>刘雅红为研究院第一届学术委员会专家</span></p><p><span>颁发聘书</span></p><p><span>学术委员会由</span><strong><span>院士牵头</span></strong></p><p><span>内地及粤港澳</span><strong><span>专家组成</span></strong></p><p><span>当天下午</span></p><section><span>研究院召开了第一届学术委员会会议</span></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlcibhf31LaxxWPdRICxvJFIGiasT0glTnQ2KQMkOAvwWBPSAvibsia4mQz5Mr2gRusDbm8ic4g0m8J6abfA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section><p><span>科研合作框架协议签约仪式</span></p><p><span>启动仪式上，研究院和</span></p><p><span>香港城市大学</span><span>海洋与人类健康研究中心</span></p><p><span>香港科技大学</span><span>中药研发中心</span></p><p><span>中山大学</span><span>水产动物疾病防控</span></p><p><span>与健康养殖全国重点实验室</span></p><section><strong><span>签订了科研合作框架协议</span></strong></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlcicxibTXuER4o5AwvQqfm8CiatcyU8ianglgGGgpNPGvFBIxegu74tLIJHHDAun91dtu9R6icF29JUu3KQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\"/></section><p><span>南沙渔业资源丰富，水产养殖业十分发达</span></p><section><span>研究院目前已建成</span></section><section><span>水产育种与种业、水产种质资源与环境、</span></section><section><span>水产病害防控、水产精准营养、</span></section><section><span>智慧渔业与设施养殖</span></section><section><strong><span>五大研究平台及团队</span></strong></section><section><span>以解决渔业产业中的实际问题为理念</span></section><p><strong><span>打造“建在塘头的研究院”</span></strong></p><section><span>2022年，研究院获评</span></section><section><span>“广州社会组织助力乡村振兴突出贡献单位”</span></section><section><span>2023年，研究院获批</span></section><section><span>华南农业大学研究生培养专项指标30人</span></section><section><span>这些新生力量的加盟</span></section><section><span>将有力支撑研究院科研工作的开展</span></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlcibhf31LaxxWPdRICxvJFIGiaBHrW2xXkHFB0aiaR08tMEVrJq18WGHdry12vUMa785xsnzI7997BMmQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section><p><span>研究院科研办公楼</span></p><p><span><span>研究院选址</span>广东省现代农业产业园——</span></p><p><span>南沙渔业产业园</span></p><p><span>由</span><strong><span>科研办公大楼、配套试验鱼塘</span></strong></p><section><strong><span>和师生宿舍</span></strong><span>等区域组成</span></section><p><span>其中</span><strong><span>科研办公大楼</span></strong></p><p><span>总面积</span><strong><span>1828.5平方米</span></strong></p><p><span>包括洁净实验室、超高温实验室、</span></p><p><span>生理生化实验室、微生物实验室、</span></p><section><span>水环境实验室、培养室、公共实验室等</span></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlcibhf31LaxxWPdRICxvJFIGiaSDNR0hiaNjb6CicfUDuDajQ0eatuEFBjH0MJvQwI6rqecITrqibFnAPqw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section><p><span>鉴于渔业科学的应用型较强</span></p><p><span>研究院还配套打造了</span></p><p><span>约</span><strong><span>300亩的试验鱼塘</span></strong></p><section><span>具有小试、中试和产业示范功能</span><strong></strong></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlcibhf31LaxxWPdRICxvJFIGiaHKItUdrfDdsWSKBuGXbASu4w9BSJ7kqgYk3P8mg7x0kfZ7uflFFEEg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section><p><span>国以农为本，农以种为先</span></p><p><span>党的二十大报告指出</span></p><p><span>树立大食物观，构建多元化食物供给体系</span></p><p><span>深入实施种业振兴行动</span></p><section><span>确保中国人的饭碗牢牢端在自己手中</span></section><p><span>未来，广州南沙渔业研究院</span></p><p><span>将继续努力</span></p><p><span>为渔业产业</span><span>高质量发展</span></p><p><strong><span>提供科技引擎</span></strong></p><p><span>为乡村振兴和渔业产业提质增效</span></p><p><strong><span>带来实实在在的好处</span></strong></p><p><span>助力国家渔业产业</span></p><p><strong><span>转型升级、提质增效</span></strong></p><p><span>为推进粤港澳大湾区建设</span></p><p><span>以及乡村振兴</span></p><p><strong><span>做出更多贡献</span></strong></p><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc8fJPwmSRBYeNFIJN8WDicrsh5n3Fff5qO3bpMGllj4Zf8bfibxq9FETR9klu27K9LFTbEugvqibYm9A/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\"/></p><section><section><section><p><strong>▶ 往期回顾</strong></p></section></section><section><section><a href=\"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652708711&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=da7be393ac5ec34ad841a4de7a5da0c8&amp;chksm=bcd61c788ba1956e8a1433a59ea2f066d92862507e0ed9d1d89a50056fefa9208c4a3260dfa4&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlcibhf31LaxxWPdRICxvJFIGiacO1K9bv4oJodadulic9ogxSK27l3areicoCQUOpF9Ssnrvjibia6HAwCpQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><p>▲ 一鸣惊人！蓄力三年，他以第一作者发表高水平论文！</p></section></section><section><section><a href=\"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652708692&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=7fedfc235a8ec24e3c2382f75528a72c&amp;chksm=bcd61c4b8ba1955d5e4e55c6ee75e4cb06ac21ebf95ff7645f27cc9ae7de2544234c5ccdd94f&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlcibhf31LaxxWPdRICxvJFIGiaSo8wy5M6ibg7PQw6glYUjKsIyKt1CwJUiaqHwiaiaMhzFydmtYq9Iq4icCQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><p>▲ 超3万优质岗位！“粤就业”农林综合类专场招聘会在华农举行</p></section></section><section><s